BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventdrinksgivingwithnumerant90sgrungebandlive26317-20261125@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261124T203629Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261126
SUMMARY:Drinksgiving with Numerant 90's Grunge band Live
DESCRIPTION:Join us for DRINKS-GIVING — Wednesday\, 11.25.26 @ 7:30 PM FREE SHOW! NO COVER! Get ready to ROCK this Drinks-giving with NUMERANT at Rockwell Brewery! Kick off Thanksgiving weekend with a night of your favorite ’90s grunge and modern rock anthems! Grab your friends\, raise a glass\, and get ready to sing along to the songs that defined a generation. From Pearl Jam and Stone Temple Pilots to Foo Fighters\, Nirvana\, The Killers\, and Rage Against the Machine\, NUMERANT is bringing the energy of ’90s and 2000s alternative rock to The Rock! NUMERANT is a five-piece grunge and modern rock band formed in 2023 in Rockville\, Maryland. Made up of seasoned musicians with years of live performance experience\, the band delivers a tight\, high-energy show featuring the biggest rock hits of the ’90s and beyond\, along with a growing collection of original music. With a setlist spanning grunge classics\, alternative rock favorites\, and crowd-pleasing anthems\, NUMERANT brings the kind of live energy that keeps audiences singing\, moving\, and rocking all night long. As Rockwell Brewery puts it: “These guys WILL rock your socks off! Good beers\, good tunes\, great band!” Don't miss NUMERANT at Rockwell Brewery this Drinks-giving! Great beer\, great music\, and a night of rock you won't forget!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/drinksgiving-with-numerant-90s-grunge-band-live/26317/
END:VEVENT
