SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Buffet at Brewer's Alley
DESCRIPTION:A Frederick Thanksgiving tradition continues at Brewer’s Alley! Gather with family and friends for our annual Thanksgiving Buffet in historic Downtown Frederick. Enjoy a carving table and buffet featuring prime rib\, roast turkey\, a raw bar\, traditional sides\, a dessert display & more! Call (301) 631-0089 for reservations. Tables fill quickly\, so reserve yours early.
