SUMMARY:FAC's Winter Artist Market
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season at the Frederick Arts Council Winter Artist Market! Join us November 27–28 at the YMCA Ausherman Arts Center for a festive shopping experience featuring unique artwork\, handmade goods\, and one-of-a-kind gifts from talented local artists. Presented in partnership with the Youth Art Alliance (YAAC)\, this is a great opportunity to shop local\, support Frederick's creative community\, and find something special for everyone on your holiday shopping list!
