SUMMARY:Frederick Card Fest
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Frederick Card Fest\, a brand-new sports card and memorabilia experience coming to Frederick! The Performance Center at Frederick Keys is partnering with Frederick Vintage Fest and Sweet Hit Cards to bring the first event of its kind to Frederick\, MD - and General Admission is FREE! Explore a massive marketplace featuring 100+ tables packed with sports cards\, memorabilia\, collectibles\, vintage finds\, and more. 100+ Sports Card & Memorabilia Tables Vintage Cards & Collectibles Sports Memorabilia Vintage VIP Hour Free General Admission Vendors from Frederick & Beyond With more than 100 tables under one roof\, Frederick Card Fest is the perfect place to spend Black Friday - whether you're hunting for that one card you've been searching for or just looking to see what you can find.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-card-fest/26388/
END:VEVENT
