SUMMARY:Frosty Friday Live Music with Crash the Limo
DESCRIPTION:CRASH THE LIMO IS CRASHING INTO JOJO’S! This Frosty Friday\, there's going to be one heck of a crash in Downtown Frederick! CRASH THE LIMO is crashing into JoJo’s Restaurant & Tap House and taking over the Delirium Stage for a night of high-energy live music and post-Thanksgiving partying! Forget the leftovers\, round up your friends\, and get ready to kick off the holiday season with a BANG! The limo's wrecked\, but the party's just getting started! Great Music. Great Beer. Great Times.
