BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthecooljerksreunionconcert26377-20261127@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261124T203629Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261128
SUMMARY:The COOL JERKS Reunion Concert
DESCRIPTION:Here is your invite to a night of awesome music\, dancing\, drinks and fun! Please join us (and all your favorite people) for the COOL JERKS reunion concert sponsored by Rice Tire Company on Black Friday\, November 27 at Rockwell Brewery. Doors open at 6:00\, music 7-11. The Cool Jerks were the band you called when you wanted a party to be unforgettable! They are known for their high energy R&B\, blazing hot horns\, a rhythm section that made you want to dance\, paired with some of the areas finest vocals. This reunion is about more than just great music! A portion of the proceeds from this special event will benefit St. Jude‘s Children’s Hospital. So here’s your chance to do something wonderful while having an absolutely unforgettable time! Call Troy Remsburg for tickets at 301-748-3181. Don't miss out on the fun! Get here early to grab a seat near the stage!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-cool-jerks-reunion-concert/26377/
END:VEVENT
